# Act II superunique leatherarm (superuniques row 14): warp 46, spawn beside the player, kill it by poke; the state channel carries minions and drops.
name a2-super-leatherarm
save ScnAm2 --class ama --expansion --gold 10000 --act 1 --quests acts=1
seed 1234
ticks 120
seconds 600
channels state packets
at 4 poke warp 46
at 10 poke superunique 14 @x+4 @y+4
at 30 poke pos 1/5 @x+3 @y
at 32 poke stat 1/5 6 0 256
at 34 poke missile 58 @x @y @x+3 @y
